  "title": "Get one AVnester property by ID"
 },
 "description": "Fetch full public details for one AVnester listing by its listingId (from search_properties results \u2014 IDs are not guessable). Listings cover Tamil Nadu; unknown or unpublished IDs return { listing: null, notFound: true } (never throws, to avoid leaking existence). Use when the user references a specific listing. State verification.caveats beside the verified flag: an approval is not a title, ownership or encumbrance check. Read-only, no side effects.",
 "execution": {
  "taskSupport": "forbidden"
 },
